    <data key="d0">Codebit Elpro Cloud Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TBKmeolOdSw</data>
    <data key="d2">Serverless containerized cloud architecture for Elpro temperature monitoring software, using AWS Fargate, Aurora Postgres on Graviton, EFS, and Transit Gateway for IoT and VPN connectivity.</data>
